# 🖼️ Batch Image Converter & Editor

[Python 3.8+](https://img.shields.io/badge/python-3.8+-blue.svg)](https://www.python.org/downloads/)
[Pillow](https://img.shields.io/badge/Pillow-Latest-green.svg)](https://python-pillow.org/)
[Tkinter](https://img.shields.io/badge/GUI-Tkinter-orange.svg)](https://docs.python.org/3/library/tkinter.html)

A lightweight, high-performance desktop GUI application for batch image conversion, transformations, and editing built with **Python**, **Tkinter**, and **Pillow (PIL)**.

Designed for photographers, web developers, and designers who need quick batch processing with an interactive visual preview, non-destructive editing, and zero risk of overwriting original files.

---

## ✨ Features

- **Non-Destructive Transformation Pipeline**:
  - Every operation (crop, resize, rotation, filter) is queued in an independent action pipeline.
  - **True Filter Toggling**: Turn filters (e.g., *Sharpen* or *Grayscale*) on or off at any point without destroying subsequent crops, resizes, or rotations.
  - Step-by-step **Undo (`Ctrl+Z`)** and full revert capabilities.
- **Universal Format Conversion**:
  - Convert between all common image formats: `JPEG`, `PNG`, `WEBP`, `BMP`, `TIFF`, `GIF`, and `ICO`.
  - Quality slider for lossy formats (`JPEG` & `WEBP`).
  - **Smart Alpha-Channel Handling**: Automatically replaces transparent alpha channels with clean white backgrounds when exporting to formats that do not support transparency (such as JPEG/BMP).
- **Flexible Batch Processing**:
  - Multi-select files in list view using `Shift + Click`, `Ctrl + Click`, or toggle checkmarks (`[✓]`).
  - Target scope selectors: Apply transformations to **Highlighted items**, **Checked items `[✓]`**, or **Active preview only**.
- **Interactive Visual Crop**:
  - Drag-and-drop bounding box directly over the live preview canvas.
  - Intelligently applies relative/proportional crops across batches with varying aspect ratios.
- **Dual-Mode Resize**:
  - **By Pixels**: Width & Height inputs with optional aspect ratio lock.
  - **By Percentage (`%`)**: Dynamic scaling (e.g., reduce all selected images by `50%` regardless of their initial resolution).
  - Mutually exclusive input fields prevent conflicting parameters.
- **Safe Timestamped Export**:
  - **Save All** exports files using a unified batch timestamp (`filename_YYYYMMDD_HHMMSS.ext`), guaranteeing original source files are never overwritten.
- **Live Canvas Preview with Dynamic Badge**:
  - Real-time scaled preview with an on-canvas HUD badge showing resolution and aspect ratio (e.g., `1920 × 1080 px (16:9)`).

