## 🚀 Installation & Setup

1. **Clone the repository**:
   ```bash
   git clone https://github.com/basaraa/some-python-scripts/py_image_processor.git
   cd batch-image-editor
   ```

2. **(Optional) Create a virtual environment**:
   ```bash
   # Windows
   python -m venv venv
   venv\Scripts\activate

   # Linux / macOS
   python3 -m venv venv
   source venv/bin/activate
   ```

3. **Install dependencies**:
   ```bash
   pip install Pillow
   ```

   > **Note for Linux users (Ubuntu/Debian):** If Tkinter is missing from your system Python, install it via:
   > ```bash
   > sudo apt update
   > sudo apt install python3-tk
   > ```

4. **Run the application**:
   ```bash
   python app.py
   ```

