## ⌨️ Keyboard Shortcuts

| Shortcut | Action |
| :--- | :--- |
| `Ctrl + Z` | **Undo Last Step** on target files |
| `Space` | **Toggle Checkmark `[✓]` / `[ ]`** on highlighted file(s) |
| `Double Click` | Toggle single item checkmark in the list |

---

## 🗂️ Supported Image Formats

| Format | Extension | Notes |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **JPEG** | `.jpg`, `.jpeg` | Quality control (1-100), auto-flattens transparency |
| **PNG** | `.png` | Full lossless RGBA support |
| **WEBP** | `.webp` | High compression efficiency, lossy quality slider |
| **BMP** | `.bmp` | Windows bitmap format |
| **TIFF** | `.tiff` | High-quality raster format |
| **GIF** | `.gif` | Single-frame export |
| **ICO** | `.ico` | Windows icon format (auto-scaled to 256x256) |

